{"s":104,"v":[{"t":"Woe to every scorner and mocker","w":[["وَيْلٌۭ","Woe","waylun",""],["لِّكُلِّ","to every","likulli","",[["لِّ",8],["كُلِّ",43]]],["هُمَزَةٍۢ","slanderer","humazatin",""],["لُّمَزَةٍ","backbiter","lumazatin",""]]},{"t":"Who collects wealth and [continuously] counts it.","w":[["ٱلَّذِى","The one who","alladhī",""],["جَمَعَ","collects","jamaʿa",""],["مَالًۭا","wealth","mālan",""],["وَعَدَّدَهُۥ","and counts it","waʿaddadahu","",[["وَ",1],["عَدَّدَ",3854],["هُۥ",5]]]]},{"t":"He thinks that his wealth will make him immortal.","w":[["يَحْسَبُ","Thinking","yaḥsabu",""],["أَنَّ","that","anna",""],["مَالَهُۥٓ","his wealth","mālahu","",[["مَالَ",145],["هُۥٓ",5]]],["أَخْلَدَهُۥ","will make him immortal","akhladahu","",[["أَخْلَدَ",2111],["هُۥ",5]]]]},{"t":"No! He will surely be thrown into the Crusher.","w":[["كَلَّا","Nay","kallā","ۖ"],["لَيُنۢبَذَنَّ","Surely he will be thrown","layunbadhanna","",[["لَ",23],["يُنۢبَذَ",861],["نَّ",0]]],["فِى","in","fī",""],["ٱلْحُطَمَةِ","the Crusher","l-ḥuṭamati","",[["ٱلْ",2],["حُطَمَةِ",2325]]]]},{"t":"And what can make you know what is the Crusher?","w":[["وَمَآ","And what","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَآ",12]]],["أَدْرَىٰكَ","will make you know","adrāka","",[["أَدْرَىٰ",558],["كَ",18]]],["مَا","what","mā",""],["ٱلْحُطَمَةُ","the Crusher (is)","l-ḥuṭamatu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["حُطَمَةُ",2325]]]]},{"t":"It is the fire of Allāh, [eternally] fueled,","w":[["نَارُ","A Fire","nāru",""],["ٱللَّهِ","Allah","l-lahi",""],["ٱلْمُوقَدَةُ","kindled","l-mūqadatu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["مُوقَدَةُ",4474]]]]},{"t":"Which mounts directed at the hearts.","w":[["ٱلَّتِى","Which","allatī",""],["تَطَّلِعُ","mounts up","taṭṭaliʿu",""],["عَلَى","to","ʿalā",""],["ٱلْأَفْـِٔدَةِ","the hearts","l-afidati","",[["ٱلْ",2],["أَفْـِٔدَةِ",599]]]]},{"t":"Indeed, it [i.e., Hellfire] will be closed down upon them","w":[["إِنَّهَا","Indeed, it","innahā","",[["إِنَّ",15],["هَا",22]]],["عَلَيْهِم","(will be) upon them","ʿalayhim","",[["عَلَيْ",19],["هِم",3]]],["مُّؤْصَ